#. y4:msg_branch_segment=T0.P28..P98
#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=I like things that have intrinsic beauty. But it's disappointing how the standard for what is considered "art" has lowered recently.
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 1c 00 00 00 03 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
