#. y4:msg_branch_target_text=I hate gambling, but I see it's not totally up to luck alone. So what should I do in order to win more efficiently? Hmm...
#. y4:msg_branch_raw=01 11 00 27 00 00 00 08 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00
msgctxt "2856_Saejima"
msgid "Gambling"
msgstr ""

